  "body_html": "<h1>IsCompletelyMixedProfile.player</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem IsCompletelyMixedProfile.player {G : StrategicGame N ℚ} [∀ i, Fintype (G.strategy i)] {p : MixedProfile G} (hp : IsCompletelyMixedProfile G p) (i : N) : IsCompletelyMixed G (p i)</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Strategy</li>\n<li>MixedProfile</li>\n<li>IsCompletelyMixedProfile</li>\n<li>IsCompletelyMixed</li>\n</ul>",
